            "review_text": "perseval13\nNice, France125 contributions\n0\nVery good place for brunch or already healthy\nJun 2025 • Solo\nVery good for a Brunch \nExcellent bagel and toast \nVery nice place. No air conditioning down but possibly does up.\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten June 6, 2025\nOwner's R\nBonjour à vous et merci pour votre visite et vos commentaires encourageants !\nEn effet, notre salle de restauration climatisée est à l'étage :-)\nTrès bonne journée à vous et au plaisir de vous accueillir à nouveau.\nCordialement,\nL'équipe de Tartine Saigon \n-—————— \nTartine Saïgon, artisan bakery-café-restaurants run by passionate sourdough bakers\n🍸🍻🍷Happy Hour every day 3-7pm\nWe are open 🕑 7am-10pm at all our locations: \n📍 Tartine Saïgon - 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - 215 Lý Tự Trọng, Q1 ❄️\n📍 Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien, Q2 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon An Phu, Q2 \n📍 Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde, Q2 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Q3 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang, Phu My Hung, Q7 ❄️🍕\nRead more\nTranslate response\nWritten August 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
