            "review_text": "Bao Chau D\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat Place for Brunch and Breakfast\nOct 2024 • Family\nNice place with great food. Highly recommended. We tried the bagel and sandwiches which are delicious. The coffee was good too.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 19, 2024\nOwner's R\nThank you for your visit and kind comments! Come back for dinner! ;-) \n\nKind regards,\nThe team of Tartine Saigon\n-—————— \nTartine Saïgon, artisan bakery-café-restaurants run by passionate sourdough bakers\n🍸🍻🍷Happy Hour every day 3-7pm\nWe are open 🕑 7am-10pm at all our locations: \n📍 Tartine Saïgon - 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - 215 Lý Tự Trọng, Q1 ❄️\n📍 Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien, Q2 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon An Phu, Q2 \n📍 Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde, Q2 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon - Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Q3 ❄️🍕\n📍 Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang, Phu My Hung, Q7 ❄️🍕\nRead more\nWritten August 17, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
