            "review_text": "grace_pyc\nSingapore, Singapore41 contributions\n0\nCafé Bakery in Thao Dien\nNov 2023 • Family\nNice vibe, modern decor, very sweet café in Thao Dien. We had the house brew Kombucha 450ml bottle. Eco-minded owner, creatively use lemongrass as straw!\nWritten November 14, 2023\nOwner's R\nHello, and thanks for your kind words. Glad you like what we do. :-) \n\nKind regards, \nThe team of Tartine Saigon\nTᴀʀᴛɪɴᴇ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ, sᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon - 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon - 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon - Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon - Thao Dien, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon - An Phu, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon - Vista Verde, Q2\n📍Tartine Saïgon - 14a Bà Huyện Thanh Quan, Q3 \n📍Tartine Saïgon - PMH Mỹ Khang, Q7\n⏰ 7am-10pm, every day for dine-in & takeaway, and baking twice a day\n🍺🍹🍷🥃Happy Hour Every Day 3-7pm #Buy1Get1Free\n🛒 You can also find our breads and goodies at our partner shops\nRead more\nWritten October 9, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
