            "review_text": "Bruce G\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam23 contributions\n0\nScheister Business - Local Cheaters\nMar 2023 • Family\nWe are living in Thảo Điện for many years and I’ve never seen any food establishment give you 4 maybe 6 ounces of Orange in a tall glass with 80% Ice filled and then charge 65,000 vnd ($2.75 USD) It is really unbelievable and a disgrace\nWritten March 21, 2023\nOwner's R\nDear 718bruceg - thanks for your visit and comments. Standard serving at all our locations for orange juice is 200ml of freshly squeezed orange juice per serving (ice added on top of that of course to fill a big glass). This is about 350-400g of squeezed oranges. If you order without ice, you would get 200ml of freshly squeezed orange juice served in a smaller glass, for the same price. Thanks for having reported the issue on the spot to our manager of our Thao Dien location, who we understand has replaced the glass of juice with the right quantity. We apologize for the inconvenience and regret you felt the need to complain here. Nonetheless, we would be delighted to invite you for another glass of orange juice on the house at a time of your convenience, and hope you come back here to enjoy our good food, quality drinks and friendly service. Have a lovely day!\n\nKind regards,\nThe team of Tartine Saigon\n\n______\nTᴀʀᴛɪɴᴇ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ, sᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien\n📍Tartine Saïgon An Phu\n📍Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde\n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang \n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Hoàng (soon in March)\n⏰ 7am-10pm, every day for dine-in & takeaway, and baking twice a day\n🍺🍹🍷🥃Happy Hour Every Day 3-7pm #Buy1Get1Free\n🛵 Order for fast delivery or pick up\n__________\n🥐🍳🥐🍳🥐\nRead more\nWritten March 23, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
