            "review_text": "NhuNgocNguyen\n5 contributions\n0\nADDICTED PASTRY\nDec 2022\nMany types of bread which is diversified for my picky habit. First time tried the chocolate croissant and it was absolutely impressive. \nLittle tip: Should ask the serve the warm it up a little bit in oven = perfecto <3\nThe plain croissant is nice, too. It's suitable for a quick breakfast if you're in rush. \nVery welcoming and helpful staff - they let me know that the bread is fresh everyday.\nthe opening time from 7AM to 10PM.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 2, 2023\nOwner's R\nDelighted to read you have found the way to get the best out of what we do. We love to see happy neighbors coming back and back again. See you again soon!\n\n______\nTᴀʀᴛɪɴᴇ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ, sᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien\n📍Tartine Saïgon An Phu\n📍Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde\n📍Tartine Saïgon PMH Mỹ Khang \n⏰ 7am-10pm, every day for dine-in & takeaway, and baking twice a day\n🍺🍹🍷🥃Happy Hour Every Day 3-7pm #Buy1Get1Free\n🛵 Order for fast delivery or pick up\n__________\n🥐🍳🥐🍳🥐\nYou can also find our breads and goodies at our partner shops\nRead more\nWritten February 20, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
