            "review_text": "Soko37\nBudapest, Hungary20962 contributions\n2\n☕️ and 🍞\nFeb 2021 • Solo\nBakery 🥯 and coffee ☕️ place for bread 🥖, baguette 🥖 or other bakery 🧁 snacks lovers. If you prefer traditional bread 🥯 receipts then you are in right place. Place is bit hidden in small street, surrounded by high blocks or Tropic garden compound. Option to have home 🏠 delivery 🚚 when buying 500,000 VND. Morning is time for people buying bread or having breakfast, later coffee shop whole day\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 16, 2021\nOwner's R\nDear Soko - many thanks for your visit and you review of our little bakery-cafe here. Glad you like it :-) \n\nKind regards,\nTartine Saigon's team of passionate bakers\n____\nSᴏᴜʀᴅᴏᴜɢʜ ʙᴀᴋᴇʀʏ-ᴄᴀғᴇ́s-ʀᴇsᴛᴀᴜʀᴀɴᴛs ɪɴ sᴜɴɴʏ Sᴀɪ̈ɢᴏɴ:\n📍Tartine Saïgon 25 Nguyen Dinh Chieu, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon 215 Ly Tu Trong, Q1\n📍Tartine Saïgon Binh Thanh\n📍Tartine Saïgon Thao Dien\n📍Tartine Saïgon An Phu\n📍Tartine Saïgon Vista Verde\nRead more\nWritten June 16, 2022\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
